SUMMARY:Community Read-Aloud of Antigone NEW
DESCRIPTION:This is an Adult School class. You can register 
 here.\n\nThere's no better way to appreciate a classical masterpiece than 
 by participating in it! Join Mary English\, the classics chair of Montclair 
 State University\, to read aloud in turns from Sophocles's legendary play\, 
 Antigone. We'll discuss the play after we read it. Bring your own book to 
