DESCRIPTION:The Mock Wedding is a cultural showcase celebrating the beauty
  and traditions of a Bengali wedding. Hosted by the Bangladesh Student As
 sociation (BSA) in collaboration with the Pakistan Student Association (P
 SA) and South Asian Student Association (SASA)\, this event provides stud
 ents with an immersive experience featuring traditional attire\, décor\, 
 music\, performances\, and authentic cuisine. Our goal is to educate the 
 campus community about South Asian wedding customs while fostering cultur
 al appreciation and unity in a fun\, welcoming environment.\n\nHosted by:
  Bangladesh Student Association \n\nAdditional Information can be found a
 t: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12985756
