SUMMARY:Hatha Flow & Yoga Nidra with Marc Holzman
DESCRIPTION:Looking to revitalize your body and calm your mind? Start your day with a harmonious blend of energy and relaxation. Blend active and dynamic Hatha yoga with a serene transition into yoga nidra–a yogic sleep meditation. This class is designed to leave you feeling balanced and refreshed. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
