SUMMARY:Swedish Christmas Fair
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy the 41st Annual Traditional Swedish Fair featuring handcrafted Christmas decorations\, home baked goods\, traditional food market\, and a Lucia celebration at 1:30pm hosted by the NJ Chapter of SWEA\, Swedish Women’s Educational Association. SWEA is a global nonprofit organization promoting Swedish language\, culture\, history\, and tradition. Fair hours are 10am- 3pm. Admission is $2. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
