CATEGORIES:Social
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a showing of the new film The Hunger Games: Sunris
 e on the Reaping with Montclair film! \nCome join Greek Life at The Belle
 vue Theatre in Montclair for a private showing of the new Hunger Games: S
 unrise on the Reaping! Your ticket will include a ticket into the theater
 \, a small drink\, and a small popcorn. Transportation is not provided\, 
 but there is plenty of parking and The Bellevue is about a mile walk from
  campus. Movie ticket information will be communicated to students on Thu
 rsday\, November 19th or after availability sells out.\nThe movie will be
