X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_north_jersey_bowling_soccer_volleyball
X-SOURCE:Meetup: NJ Bowling, Volleyball, Tennis & More
UID:event_317217050@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261121T064931Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261128T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261128T120000
SUMMARY:Weekend Warrior Tennis (Saturdays)
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\nJoin us for
  friendly and sociable free rallies and possibly some informal matches for
  training and fun. We are beginner to intermediate levels but all are welc
 ome. We don’t allow formal instruction on our group-reserved courts\, al
 though giving some quick tips is OK so long as you’re not holding up oth
 ers waiting to play.\n\n⛑️ **Clinic Matches:** If we have to rotate pe
 ople in then we may play some clinic-style matches where everyone rotates 
 in evenly. There is no holding the court via wins so everyone has a chance
  to play regardless of skill level.\n\n🕊️ **Early Bird Start:** If yo
 u want to meet earlier than 9 AM (like 8 or 8:30) then please let us know 
 by the day before and we’ll see who can join you (usually I can do earli
 er).\n\n**🎾 Equipment:** Please bring your own racquet and water\, as w
 e don’t provide those. I always have some balls for at least one court\,
  but feel free to bring your own in case we need to branch out over more t
 han one court.\n\n👟 **Court Priority:** Those who are signed up and sho
 w up by 9 AM will have top priority for court space. Those who show up lat
 er have second priority while those who are wait-listed will have third pr
 iority. This is only in the event that we have to rotate people in.\n\n**
 🧯DISCLAIMER:** Courts are subject to availability and weather. If you m
 ake plans to attend please be prepared to cancel or adjust our location as
  needed. Furthermore\, by attending you agree to be fully responsible for 
 your own health and safety. Each person is responsible to take a break for
  rest and water at their own discretion.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/317217050/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261031T033508Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261031T033508Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Themindfulstream": "https://www.meetup.com/themindfulstream/events/317339348/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_themindfulstream
X-SOURCE:Meetup: The Mindful Stream
UID:event_317339348@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261121T064932Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261128T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261128T103000
SUMMARY:5 Week Course: The Work on Inadequacy (Timing Option A) Price - Sl
 iding Scale
DESCRIPTION:The Mindful Stream\nTo celebrate 5 years of The Work Runs Free
 \, Emrys has created The Work on Inadequacy. Over 5 weeks\, we explore dif
 ferent ways the experience of inadequacy shows up in our lives\, using The
  Work to investigate our experience.\n\nSign up form: [Click Here](https:/
 /docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeQVso7QaCu9ubv5E_74f50c6vvp2nt7zx8zMWnl
 GkwaNIYMw/viewform?usp=preview)\nDetailed Course Outline: [Click Here](htt
 ps://docs.google.com/document/d/1eQYHU2jgRlNoO_XZDEjj08EhT8jeHk0h2zAOnEogl
 gM/edit?usp=sharing)\n\n**Sliding Scale Price:** $120 — Accessible rate 
 / $150 — Standard rate / $180 — Pay it forward\n\n**Week 1 — I'm Not
  Good Enough:** The fundamental inadequacy story.\n**Week 2 — Comparison
 :** Measuring ourselves against other people.\n**Week 3 — I'm a Fraud / 
 They'll Find Me Out:** Imposter feelings\, competence and exposure.\n**Wee
 k 4 — Being Loved\, Accepted & Enough:** Inadequacy in relationships\, b
 elonging and being seen by others.\n**Week 5 — Achievement & Where I Sho
 uld Be:** Success\, progress\, potential and the feeling that we should be
  further along.\n\nThe course gently moves from the broader experience of 
 inadequacy into increasingly specific areas where it can show up in our li
 ves.\n\nAs we gently move into each topic\, you are invited to become stil
 l and notice any stressful thought\, belief or experience that arises thro
 ugh the inquiry\, and to write it down — either on a notepad or in an el
 ectronic document.\n\nEach session explores one stressful thought\, or “
 one-liner\,” using a format known as Popcorn Work. This is the same appr
 oach Emrys uses in his weekly *[The Work Runs Free](https://www.meetup.com
 /thework-runsfree/)* group. Everyone participates in their own inquiry\, b
 ut there is no expectation to share. You are equally welcome to keep your 
 inquiry entirely private\, if that feels right for you.\n\nThe group is de
 liberately small\, with a maximum of 10 participants\, allowing us to expl
 ore together while each person remains connected to their own experience.\
 n\nPlease note that this is a paid course. In order to join you must regis
 ter for the event (sign up form above). The Zoom link for this event will 
 be sent around 24 hours after registration and payment has been made.\n\n*
 *To book a free introductory private session of The Work with Emrys\, [cli
 ck here](https://calendly.com/mindfulnesswithemrys/onehoursession)[.](http
 s://mindfulnesswithemrys.business.site/)**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/themindfulstream/events/317339348/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261108T141943Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261108T141943Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
