SUMMARY:AI Basics in Gemini and Claude for Seasoned Professionals NEW
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to register. 
 \n\nDiscover how Gemini and Claude can help you write\, create\, organize 
 information\, and complete real-world projects more efficiently. In this 
 hands-on\, two-session course\, you’ll practice effective prompting\; 
 create written and visual content\; develop tables and spreadsheets\; 
 explore Gemini’s integration with Google tools and Canvas\; and use 
 Claude Artifacts and Projects to build and manage your work. Bring your 
 laptop and your own ideas or projects so you can experiment during class 
 and leave with practical workflows you can use right away. No advanced AI 
 experience is required.
LOCATION:Montclair Bellevue Ave Branch - Classroom\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult School
UID:LibCal-10306-18038953
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/18038953
END:VEVENT
