DESCRIPTION:❄️✨ WOCA WEEK IS HERE! ✨❄️\nJoin WOCA for a week full of holid
 ay fun\, creativity\, community\, and sisterhood! From karaoke and bouque
 t making to giving back\, movie night\, and our 3rd Annual Friendsmas Com
 petition\, we have something for everyone!\nGrab your friends\, bring you
