SUMMARY:Needle Felting: Create a Holiday Gnome
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Register here. \n\nCreate 
 your own charming holiday gnome in this cozy\, beginner‑friendly 
 needle‑felting workshop. Students can choose from a variety of festive 
 wool colors to design a gnome that matches their holiday décor or becomes 
 a one‑of‑a‑kind handmade gift. You’ll be guided step‑by‑step by 
 the instructor\, learning how to shape wool\, attach felted pieces 
 securely\, and add adorable details that bring your gnome to life. No prior 
 experience is needed — this workshop is perfect for first‑time felters 
 and anyone who enjoys creative\, relaxing craft time. By the end of class\, 
 you’ll leave with a finished holiday gnome ready to display\, gift\, or 
 treasure.
LOCATION:Montclair - Cornerstone Montclair\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult School
UID:LibCal-10306-17300287
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17300287
END:VEVENT
