SUMMARY:Ink and Insight: Writing for Mental Health and Happiness
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult school class. Please register 
 here.\n\nJournaling is an incredible tool for nurturing mental health and 
 finding happiness. It allows us to reduce stress\, release emotions\, build 
 mindfulness\, and gain self-awareness—especially when it comes to 
 identifying unhealthy patterns or habits. There are countless ways to 
 approach journaling\, each offering its own unique benefits to support 
 better mental well-being.\n\nIn this two-session workshop\, we’ll explore 
 various journaling methods and delve into the specific advantages of each. 
 Together\, we’ll even dedicate time to put pen to paper and experience 
 the therapeutic power of journaling firsthand.\n
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Tower Room\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult School
UID:LibCal-10306-17206946
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17206946
END:VEVENT
