SUMMARY:Graphic Novel Book Club (18 ) Aterios Polyp by David Mazzucchelli
DESCRIPTION:Asterios Polyp by David Mazzucchelli\n\nThe triumphant return 
 of one of comics’ greatest talents\, with an engrossing story of one 
 man’s search for love\, meaning\, sanity\, and perfect architectural 
 proportions. An epic story long awaited\, and well worth the 
 wait.\n\nCopies of the book will be available to pick up at the BAB 
 Library. \n\nRegistration is required.\n\nThis book club is exclusive for 
 those 18 or older\, as some materials may contain content not suitable for 
 younger audiences.\n\n\n
