SUMMARY:Let's Make Vegan Coquito for the Holidays!
DESCRIPTION:Register here. \n\nWant to make coquito\, the holiday Puerto 
 Rican elixir of the gods? In this interactive class\, you'll learn about 
 the history of coquito and make a vegan version with fellow participants. 
 Instructor Michael Aquino will guide you through creating this creamy 
 holiday drink\, which is both dairy-free and egg-free. We'll be making an 
 alcohol-free version\, but participants are welcome to bring their own rum 
 if they would like to add some to their own bottle! (White rum 
 recommended.) Everyone will go home with their own bottle of coquito and 
 maybe the start of a new holiday tradition.
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Auditorium\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult School, Culinary
UID:LibCal-10306-14996311
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/14996311
END:VEVENT
