 mind that comes with getting the important stuff in order. Join author and 
 organizing humorist Jamie Novak\, when she shares the things that belong in 
 your ER Box and GO BINDER. She'll share all her must-know lists and tips to 
 get things in order - easily. \n\nVirtual Program | Registration 
 Required\nOPEN to all
