SUMMARY:Crafting Circle
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261220T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261220T153000
UID:tribe-3099@nertamid.org
DESCRIPTION:Do you do a handicraft? Get together with your fellowTNTersfor
  2 hours of crafting.Bring your knitting\, needlepoint\, embroidery\, croc
 het\, lace-making\, cross-stitch\, or whatever handicraft you are working 
 on and join us for schmoozing\, learning from each other and community. We
  meet once a month on a Sunday afternoon at TNT.
URL:https://nertamid.org/event/crafting-circle-4/
X-SOURCE:Temple Ner Tamid
END:VEVENT
