 s at Holy Spirit Verona\, this worship is geared more to children and wi
 ll include an <b><span>interactive Children's Sermon</span></b>.</span><sp
 an> </span><p><span>To <b><span>join the service online or via the telep
 hone use the below information.</span></b></span></p><p><span>Via computer
 /smartphone (ideally with a camera and microphone): </span><span><a href=
 "https://zoom.us/j/2010208686" target="_blank"><b><span>https://zoom.us/j/
 2010208686</span></b></a></span></p><p><span>Telephone(for audio only): 1 
 (646) 876 9923 - Meeting ID: 201 020 8686</span></p><p><span>Email </sp
 an><span><a href="mailto:office@holyspiritverona.org?subject=Worship%20Pas
 sword" target="_blank"><b><span>office@holyspiritverona.org</span></b></a>
 </span><span> for the <b><span>required passcode</span></b>.</span></p><
 p><span>For a copy of our <b><span>Worship Booklet</span></b>\, </span><
