DESCRIPTION:Our very active 65 plus community meets twice monthly on Tuesd
 ays from 11:15am – 1:15pm during the year and once a month during the su
 mmer for stimulating conversations\, guest speakers\, cultural programming
 \, holiday celebrations\, Qi Gong exercise and much more.The group is open
