SUMMARY:Midday Meetup - Security\, Frauds and Scams
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270113T123000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270113T143000
DTSTAMP:20261119T070314Z
UID:TU2184568953
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20270113T123000
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Events
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261009T232459Z
DESCRIPTION:**Midday MeetUp**   \nA monthly gathering to make connections
  and learn together.  \n12:30pm Catered Lunch (free)  \n1:00pm  Featured 
 Program (Note earlier start time)  \n   \n**Topic:** Security\, Frauds an
 d Scams  \n**Presenter:** Gregory Drucks\,  Director of Community Securi
 ty Training for the Jewish Federation of Greater MetroWest  \n  \nCost:*
 * FREE or Suggested Donation of $10 per person to offset costs. (Bill My 
 Account is only open to Shomrei Members)  \n  \n**RSVP:** Required so we 
 know how much food to buy.  \nLink TBA\, please check back  \n  \n**\\*\\*
 ** Members should bring their fobs to enter the building.  \n   \n**Abou
 t the Program**  \nScammers count on catching us off guard. An urgent phon
 e call\, a convincing email or even an AI-generated voice that sounds like
  someone you know can make it hard to tell what’s real. Fraud and scams 
 cost Americans billions of dollars each year\, but a few simple habits can
  help you protect yourself and your family.  \n  \nJoin Gregory Drucks for
  a practical conversation about spotting scams by phone\, email and on soc
 ial media. You’ll learn to recognize pressure tactics and false urgency\
 , verify who’s really contacting you and use a family password to guard 
 against voice-cloning scams. Gregory will share tips for staying safe onl
 ine and explain how to respond\, report a scam and get help if you’ve be
 en targeted.  \n  \n**About the Speaker**  \nGregory Drucks is the Direct
 or of Community Security Training for the Jewish Federation of Greater
  Metro-West NJ\, where he focuses on safety\, security\, and fraud preve
 ntion. He is a retired Sergeant from the Livingston Police Department wit
 h over 27 years of law enforcement experience. Greg specializes in comm
 unity safety\, security training\, and protecting vulnerable populations
 . He is actively involved in facilitating security forums and training s
 essions for community members and local organizations..   \n  \nAddition
 al_Dates_for_for_Midday_MeetUps: https://shomrei.org/calendar/midday-meetu
 p-calendar  \n  \n**Questions?** Contact Office   \noffice@shomrei.org  
  \n  \n\\#middaymeetup\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261119T054955Z
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL;VALUE=URI:https://teamup.com/kstx8swyw669kakgqa/events/2184568953
X-SOURCE:Congregation Shomrei Emunah
END:VEVENT
