 ays from 11:15am – 1:15pm during the year and once a month during the su
 mmer for stimulating conversations\, guest speakers\, cultural programming
 \, holiday celebrations\, Qi Gong exercise and much more.The group is open
  to Temple Ner Tamid members and parents and friends of members. If you or
  anyone you know is interested in meeting new people in an inviting atmosp
 here\, come give us a try! The group is sponsored by Temple Ner Tamid & JC
