DESCRIPTION:Times to be announced soon.Join us for an enchanting Cream Tea
  or Afternoon Tea in the House Living Room at Van Vleck House & Gardens!Up
 on arrival\, you will be offered a menu of fine teas and infusions. Your c
 hoice of tea will be brewed to perfection. Once everyone is settled in\, t
