SUMMARY:Friends Book Sale: The Dolores Capalbo Book Sale - Nutley Cardholders Preview Sale Day
DESCRIPTION:Join the Friends of the Nutley Public Library at the Dolores 
 Capalbo Book Sale. The Book Sale will be held on April 14\, 15\, 16 & 
 17.\n\nDonation Days will begin on April 10. We ask that you please save 
 and hold onto the items you will be donating until we can accept them at 
 the Library on April 10\, 12 & 13.\n\nAll proceeds from the sale are used 
 to support the Nutley Public Library’s programs and collections. The Book 
 Sale has been one of the most successful fundraisers\, and we appreciate 
 all your support. For additional information\, please call 973-667-0405 
 x2604.\n\nDonation Days:\nApril 10\, 12\, 13: 10:00 a.m. - 4:00 
 p.m.\n\nSale Days:\nApril 14: 4:00 p.m. - 7:00 p.m. (Nutley Cardholders 
 Preview Sale Day)\nApril 15: 10:00 a.m. - 7:00 p.m.\nApril 16: 10:00 a.m. - 
 4:00 p.m.\nApril 17: 10:00 a.m. - 4:00 p.m.\n\nLocation:\nNutley Public 
 Library\nStockton Room\n93 Booth Drive\nNutley\, NJ 
 07110\n973-667-0405\nlibrary@nutleynj.org
LOCATION:Nutley - Stockton Room\, Nutley Free Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Nutley Library":MAILTO:events@nutley.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Book Sale
UID:LibCal-10315-18022334
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/18022334
END:VEVENT
