SUMMARY:The LeeRae O'Brien Author Tea Evening and Book Signing with Joseph Cervasio
DESCRIPTION:Save the date! Join the Friends of the Nutley Public Library 
 for our annual LeeRae O’Brien Author Tea with Joseph Cervasio\, Nutley 
 resident and author of Bad News on the Doorstep\, on Wednesday\, May 19\, 
 2027\, at 6:30 p.m. The Evening Tea and Book Signing will feature 
 refreshments\, a tricky tray\, music\, and a discussion with the author. 
 Check back soon for more details.
